  <para style="h">Qimotaide Huaisan Ji 2 Hui Xin</para>
  <para style="toc1">Qimotaide Huaisan Ji 2 Hui Xin</para>
  <para style="toc2">2Qimotai</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Qim</para>
  <para style="mt">Qimotaide Huaisan Ji 2 Hui Xin</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kielien Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Hudai isighala Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de shitu danladene Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char> dain giesan aminde oluzhi wilie giesan <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <verse eid="2TI 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>oresan <char style="pn">Qimotai</char> kewondene xin huaizho. Ada Huda, mai Ezhan Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char> chade nenjien, ubali xiiku, pinnan, ogi gie!<verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gouxioxide Oluzhi Shouku Gieye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Bi xieni udu onxian giekude ese beidene chii sumulazhi Hudade mafan kieliezho. Hheshi bi xienrenlane mutun gou lianxinghala beiisan Huda wo. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Chi wilasan nughusunyi bi sumula irese hende chii chujiegheku duran wo. Ingiese bi hende bayasune. <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>Chii zhenzhenji xinyanni bi jila irezho. Ene xinyanshi chii wineinei <char style="pn">Loi</char>, anachii <char style="pn">Yuniji</char>ni zhughenughun wo, chii zhughede bikui bi hende xianxin giezho. <verse eid="2TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Ene yenyin jiere bi chii qixin gieye. Bi khane chii jiere teizhi onxian giekude Huda ogisan nenjienni khan mutun ondagha. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Ingiekushi Huda matande ayiku zhughe ese ogizho, nenli, oreku, goyane gonjiku zhughe ogizho. <verse eid="2TI 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Ingiese chi mai Ezhande ganzhen beizhi bi Ezhanyi yenyin jiere fanren gholuse shizhene bu gie. Matan Hudai nenlighala gouxioxide hhantu shouku gieye. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>Huda mai jiuizhi zhiguide urukushi matan giesanghala pusho, hhe goya jihua, nenjienghalane giesan wo. Ene nenjienshi Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i tungo giezhi duyai zhayaghasanse melie matande ogisan wo, <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>ede mai jiuichen Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char> irese man mejieghawo. Hhe fugukui widaghazhi gouxioxighala ulie fuku aminni qinchude mejieghawo. <verse eid="2TI 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>Ene gouxioxide oluzhi mii peizhi chonjichen, shitu, loushi danlaghawo. <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>Ene yenyin jiere bi enezighan kui shouizhoma, shizhene ulie giene. Ingiekushi bi kiende kouisanne mejiene. Pse hhe niudu kurutula bi hhende jiuizhi ogisei hhe baohu gie shidakui bi hende xianxin giezho. <verse eid="2TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Chi Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i tungo giezhi iresan xinyan, oreku zhugheghala mase chenliesan olusan daolini yanzi mutun gie. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Chi mai sudoro sousan Shenlinghala chade jiuizhi ogisan boubeini ghurazhi goudagha. <verse eid="2TI 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/><char style="png">Yaxiya</char> kunla man mii benda jiesei chi mejiene. Hhelai dunda <char style="pn">Feijilu</char>, <char style="pn">Heimoqini</char> wine. <verse eid="2TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Ezhan <char style="pn">Anisefu</char>i nie gie kunde ubali xii gie. Hhe mii zhughei chan bayasughazho. Mii jieliughala sozilase ye ese shizhezho. <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>Da <char style="png">Loma</char>de bikude mii hende ereidene ereizhi oluwo. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Ezhan hhe udude hhende ubali xii gie. Hhe <char style="png">Ifuso</char>de matugiezhi mii ologhonni ushilasei chi qinchu wo.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Mexiha Ersade Hen Budui Danla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Ingiese mii kewonya, chi Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i nenjien jiere khiduzhe. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>Chi olon ganzhen beisan kunlai melie mase chenliesanlai kekaoji kunlade jiuizhi ogizhi pse hhela kunlade surugha gie. <verse eid="2TI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Chi Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de hen budui danlazhi mare hhantu ku shoui. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Kien budui danlase goya shiqinghalane jiohoro ulie gieghazhi hhei budui danlaghasan kunyi bayasughane. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Kien bisai giekude zhao guijinzhe ulie giese ji 1 min danla dane. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Khishulasan zhonjia kun indan xien taranni ghurane. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Bi kieliesan kielienlai goude sumula. Ezhan chade yan shiqindeliuzhe agheli ogine.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>
    <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai jila. Hheshi fugusan kun dundase aminne olusan wo, <char style="pn">Dawude</char>ni houdei wo. Eneshi bi chonjisan gouxioxi wo. <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>Bi ene gouxioxide oluzhi fanren mutun mii banlazhi ku shouiwo. Ingieliuzhe Hudai daolii banla dane. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Ingiese Huda sunghusan kunlade <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihase iresan jiuiku, chanqiku famai ireghane giese bi yandeliuzhe rennai giezho. <verse eid="2TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Ene kielienshi zhenzhenji xianxin giekuni wo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">"Matan hhere hhantu fuguse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">hhere hhantu aminne olune.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>Matan rennai giese</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">hhere hhantu honshan danlane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Matan hhei ulie tanise</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">hheye mai ulie tanine.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Matan kekao uwoliuzhe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">hhe dou kekao wo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">Hhe goyane ghudandu dane."<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Huda Chenren Giesan Wiliechi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Chi enezighan shiqinlai hhelade qixin gie. Kielien jiere bu jianjindu giezhi Hudai melie hhelade fenfula. Ene yama haochu uwo, zi chenliesan kunlai qida olughane. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Chi xiacha giezhi yama shizhekui wizhi Huda chenren giesan wiliechi gholu. Zhendaoni ulie codaghazhi goude jianji. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Yama genzi witu duyani kielienlase gholodo. Ene izhun kielien kunlai yebeiseye Hudase gholodoghane. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Hhelai kielien neizhen niekielien wo, yefuseye fugiedane. Hhelai dunda <char style="pn">Ximinai</char>, <char style="pn">Feilitu</char> wine. <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>Hhela aminne olusan shiqin daowo giezhi kieliedene zhendaose wirulawo. Ingiezhi ezighan kunlai xianxin giesei qida olughawo. <verse eid="2TI 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Ingieliuzhe Hudai khidun jichu tashi undan wo. Jiereni, "Ezhan kienshi hhenughun bikui mejiene." pse, "Kien Ezhanyi nierei waradase gou winise likai gie." giezhi huaizho.<verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Bayan giede injisan ighalashi gon antan, miengughala giesan pusho, muzha, wazhaghala gieseiye wine. Niezhanlai zhunyonide injine, niezhanlai ibannide injine. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Kien goyane ganjinrazhi enezighan doghunnilase likai giese guizhunni igha gholune. Zhiguitu gholughazhi danxin jiese Ezhan injise heshi wo, yanyanji gou shiqin giekude zhunbei giene. <verse eid="2TI 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Chi nasuchighan kunni nefuxinni piizhi ganjin zhugheghala Ezhanse waradachen kunlare hhantu gundanni, xinyanni, orekuni, heqini dagha. <verse eid="2TI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Yama ulie mejieku benni jianjindukuse gholodo. Ene zinen kunni jianjinduzhi hendaghane. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Ezhanni hojila ulie jianjindukuni wo. Indan jien kunlade renyide duidai giezhi goude surughazhi rennai giekuni wo. <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>Fandui giesan kunde renyide sughakuni wo. Ingiese kenen Huda hhelade geizhen gieku zhughe ogise zhendaoni mejiene. <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>Ibilisi bareidene Ibilisini kielienyi chenliesan hhela xiereidene Ibilisini onse andane.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Duya Baraku Qinkon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Duya barakude chijia shihou kuzhekui chi mejie. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Hhe shihoude kunla zi goyane guine, baerni neiine, goyane kuaizhi fugiede uzhene, suibiende sugiene, ana adane kielienyi ulie chenliene, kunlai gouni matane, xienlian witui giene, <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>zhughede orekui uwo, kunlai ulie rouliene, doghun kielienghala beimiende kieliene, goyane kunzhi ulie giene, yedou no wo, gouni giekude xiqi uwo, <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>kunlai ghudandune, ulie sumulazhi hu giene, goyane bi wo giezhi undude uzhene, hu nadukude Hudase olon orene, <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>jiomunni gieku yanzi winema, jiomunni nenlii chenren ulie giene. Chi imutu kunlase gholodo. <verse eid="2TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Hhelai dunda kunlai giede zhomuji oro naozi witu biereilai shunjighachen kun wine. Ene izhun biereila zuini beiliezhi yanyanji nefuxin hhelai miizho. <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>Hhela chan suruzhoma, izhi zhendaoni minbai olu dane. <verse eid="2TI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>Eqighandei <char style="pn">Yani</char>, <char style="pn">Yanbi</char>ghala matugiezhi <char style="pn">Musa</char>i duiku mutun enezighan kunlaye qingiezhi zhendaoni duizho. Hhelai zhughe qida oluwo, xinyannishiye jiani wo. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Ingieliuzhe hhelanughun chenji dane. Hhelai benni hhe ghua kun mutun olon kunlai melie khizhene.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Qimotaide Zuihou Fenfulazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Ede bi surughasan, bi gieku yanzi, mii ibeiku fanxian, xinyan, rennai gieku, oreku, khidunde beiku, <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>da bi <char style="png">Anqiya</char>, <char style="png">Igenien</char>, <char style="png">Luside</char>de shouisan kui, mii heisan shiqinlai chi man uzhezhi mejiewo. Mii heisan zhenzhenji fugie wo! Ingieliuzhe Ezhan mii enelase jiuizhi likai gieghawo! <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Shijishan Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i sudoro xienliande udu daone giesan kunla man heikuni shouine. <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>Doghun kun, piendachen kun yebeiseye doghunshine. Hhela kunlai piendazho, kunlaye hhelai piendane. <verse eid="2TI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Ingieliuzhe chi surusanne, xianxin giesanne goude barei. Chade surughasan kunlai chi qinchu wo, <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>pse chi gaxienzise zhiguitu jinwunni mejiene. Ene jinwun chi Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i xianxin giese jiuiku hhe aghelii ogine. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>Jinwunshi man Huda kunyi zhughei gojiolughazhi gieghasan wo. Kunlade surughakude, kheilakude, geizhen gieghakude, olusanyi gieghakude zoin wine. <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>Ingiezhi giese Hudai kunni hen kun gholughazhi yanyanji gou wilie giekude zhunbei gieghane.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Hudai melie, jianlai amitu kun, fugusan kunyi panjiku Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i melie, pin <char style="pn">Ersa</char> xienjiku, pse hhei qienlighala chade hende fenfulaye. <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>Chi Hudai kielienyi chonji. Shihou heshi winu uwoliuzhe izhigie gie. Kunlade sughakude hende rennai giezhi geizhen giegha, kheila, pse sughazhi kielie. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Ingiezhi kieliekushi hhe shihou kuzhese kunla olusan daolini ulie chenliedene duranghalane goya chenlieku xiqi bitu kielienyi jianjiku loushilai ereizhi olodoghane. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Dou zhendaoi ulie chenliezhi kharei hu kieliesan guhuani daghane.<verse eid="2TI 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Ingieliuzhe chi yandeliuzhe jinshenshighan, ku shouikuse bu ayi, gouxioxii chonjichen kunyi wiliei giezhi goya renwune onchen gie. <verse eid="2TI 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Ede mii Hudade khughone giezhi zhunbei giezho, duyase likai gieku ghujinlazho. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Bi nie gou zhan ijin eghiwo, holuku moni holu baraghawo, xinyanniye izhi bareizho. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Ede gundanni jianlii made liuizho. Gundanghala panjiku Ezhan hhe udude made ogine. Zinie made ogikui pusho, Hhe pse xienjikui panjichen kunladeye ogine.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Goyane Shiqinyi Fenfulazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Chi jinlianji ghujighan mii enende ire. <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/><char style="pn">Jima</char> duyani shei dazhi mii benda jiedene <char style="png">Qiesalonijia</char>de echiwo. <char style="pn">Geleshi</char> <char style="png">Jialatai</char>de echiwo. <char style="pn">Qido</char> <char style="png">Damatai</char>de echiwo. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Zinie <char style="pn">Lujia</char> bighala hhantu wo. Chi irekude <char style="pn">Make</char>i uduru ire. Hhe bi chonjiku wiliede zoin wine. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>Bi <char style="pn">Tuijigu</char>i peizhi <char style="png">Ifuso</char>de echighawo. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>Chi irekude <char style="png">Teloya</char>ni <char style="pn">Jiabu</char>ni giede bi jiesan jienyimi, pse hhezighan shu, tebieshi hhe ghoni arasun shulai agidei ire. <verse eid="2TI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>Tun giesan kun <char style="pn">Yalishanda</char> olon doghun shiqin giezhi mii heiwo. Ezhan zhao hhe giesan mutun hhende bouin giene. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>Chiye hhei xioxin gie. Hhe matanyi kielienyi hende fandui giezho. <verse eid="2TI 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Mii ji 1 hui shenwun giekude kiema made banman ese giezhi da mii bendawo. Bi xiwon giese ene zuini Huda hhelade bu ogi gie. <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Ingieliuzhe Ezhan mii kanzide beizhi made lilian ogiwo. Mii gouxioxii chonji baraghadene niman kunlade man chenlieghawo. Hhe dou mii shizii amanse jiui khizhewo. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Ezhan mii yanyanji doghun shiqinlase jiui khizhezhi asiman jieredu hhei gojiade pinnan oroghane. Kuaikui chanqi izhi hhende ogi. Amine!<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zuihoude Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>
    <char style="pn">Baijila</char>, <char style="pn">Yajila</char>, pse <char style="pn">Anisefu</char>i nie gie kunlade kielien asa. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/><char style="pn">Iladu</char> <char style="png">Gelindo</char>de souwo. <char style="pn">Telofeimo</char> gienmerese bi hhei <char style="png">Milidu</char>de feilieghawo. <verse eid="2TI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Chi uncha orotula ghujighan mii enende ire. <char style="pn">Yubulo</char>, <char style="pn">Buqien</char>, <char style="pn">Linu</char>, <char style="pn">Gelaojiya</char> pse gaijiula man chade kielien asazho.<verse eid="2TI 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Ezhan chighala hhantu bi gie. Hhei nenjienye tanre hhantu bi gie!<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
